/*
Expected output:
inner check
inner always
outer always
returned 3

A return inside an always block, where that check is inside another check
block with its own always block. The inner always block must not run again
because of the return; the outer always block runs once, then the value
reaches the caller.

Each check block has a detect block that is never reached, so this tests
the return, not the separate problem with an always block that has no
detect block.
*/

class Main
    action Main
        output "returned " + GetValue()
    end

    action GetValue returns integer
        check
            check
                output "inner check"
            detect e
                output "inner detect"
            always
                output "inner always"
                return 3
            end
        detect e
            output "outer detect"
        always
            output "outer always"
        end
        return 0
    end
end
